WEBVTT

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:10.610
Master Hake told me to take care of Master Keita.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.310
I'm Nadeshiko, an Inukami.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.680
I may be inexperienced, but please take care of me.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:35.260
How nice.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.270
It's not nice at all!

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.600
Hake, what's the meaning of this?

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.170
Depending on your answer,
I'll burn you

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.410
and invade the main house of Kawahira!

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:47.680
Calm down, Yoko.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:51.710
We want you to become a proper Inukami.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.380
So we'll have Nadeshiko be your example.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.950
Please learn to be a bit gentler.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.120
I don't need that!

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.730
I don't need it, so hurry and take that old maid back.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:07.830
But Nadeshiko said that

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:11.370
she has been interested in Master Keita for a while.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.970
In that case, she fits this role.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:16.210
But that's not what he promised.

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.970
Yoko, I know everything.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.510
Who buys you clothes using living expenses?

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:28.320
And who cleans, does laundry, and cooks every day?

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:30.620
Keita.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.560
He's a kind person.
I believe there is no objection?

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:39.760
But, I don't want Nadeshiko there!

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.900
Nadeshiko will be staying for a week.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:44.770
Humbly learn from her,

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:49.340
and give Master Keita a surprise after Nadeshiko leaves.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:57.680
This is our chance.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.850
Nadeshiko never fights nor cooperates with us.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.190
Let's make her stay at
Keita Kawahira's forever.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:07.690
You're absolutely right.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:11.630
9 people is plenty for cooking and laundry.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:15.200
Besides, she's been cared for by Master Kaoru too much.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:20.570
Then, Tayune and Tomohane,
I'll leave Nadeshiko's surveillance to you.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.010
Understood!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:32.480
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:35.890
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:42.730
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:59.240
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:06.350
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:12.920
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:20.700
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:25.230
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:29.240
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.540
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:38.110
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:42.590
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:45.820
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:51.860
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.130
"Preventive Apron!"

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.040
I'm back.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.340
Thank you, my dreams.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.840
What the heck are you doing?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.380
Nadeshiko.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.880
I can't believe it's you, of all people.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:15.020
Yoko, are you unhappy about me coming?

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.050
Of course!

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.760
Wait, you know each other?

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:25.260
Yes, we're both Inukami from a small mountain.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.030
In any case, I don't approve of this.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:32.770
Absolutely not.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:37.410
Let's get to know each other.
What are your 3 sizes?

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.710
Don't take advantage of the commotion!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.010
Umm, I don't know.
I never measured them myself.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.520
You too. Don't answer him seriously.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:51.190
Really? What a coincidence.
I've never measured either.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.390
So let's measure each other.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.160
Keita.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.830
Nadeshiko

00:04:58.830 --> 00:04:59.700
Teleport!

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.770
Oh stop. That's my...

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.310
Yoko, I'm sorry.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.650
A whole week before Nadeshiko leaves.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.320
I can't wait that long.

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:27.260
Keita does act nice once in a while.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:31.230
But if Nadeshiko lived in the same house...

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.830
N-Nadeshiko.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.370
No!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.540
I will never allow that.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:46.710
I have to do something so
Nadeshiko leaves immediately.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:50.650
Geez, you can't even clean or cook.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:53.720
And you call yourself a wife of the Hashimotos?

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.720
This is it.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.990
Excuse me, Nadeshiko.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.190
Yes?

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.760
What do you mean, "yes?"

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.860
Geez, youngsters these days.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:07.430
Were you even looking when you cleaned?

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.700
Look, so much dust...

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.040
It's clean.

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:15.840
There's so much...

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.270
So much...

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:19.940
What are you doing?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.680
Shut up, you!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:27.020
Nadeshiko, the Kawahira family is strict about organizing trash.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:29.920
I did so, more or less.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:32.760
It's perfect.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.220
Let's eat.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.660
Nadeshiko.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:42.300
Is it not to your liking?

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.770
No. It's really delicious.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.540
I won!

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:51.270
Umm, what is it?

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.080
You still don't wear a bra?

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.410
I see.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:00.080
You may be perfect at cleaning and cooking.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.450
But a woman's about breasts, boobs, tits.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.890
Yoko, please stop.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:09.020
Come on, don't hide it.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.490
Show me your sad boobs.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:18.000
This is a scam.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.000
You look skinnier in clothes.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.840
Is that so? No one's ever said that.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:26.810
Show me your tail.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.480
Wait, Yoko.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.450
It's so slim.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.350
Geez, why does it have to be you?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.520
I would've won completely if it weren't you.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.730
I'm sorry.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:51.570
But when Master Hake told me,
I was really happy.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.940
The first time Master Keita came to the mountain,

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:58.510
he kept running for a whole night.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:02.740
Two full days off per week, and there's bonus pay.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.750
It will be a bright workplace with no secrets.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.420
By the way, the wage is negotiable.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.790
Come forth, motivated and cute Inukami!

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:15.090
The others before him just anxiously accepted

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:18.290
the evaluations from the Inukami.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.200
But Master Keita was different.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:23.630
It was very refreshing and funny.

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.040
Hey, stop. It's dangerous.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.410
No, I will do it. I have to do it.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.410
Ouch.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.280
What was that?

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.580
Yeah, I wonder what that was.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.320
But I think your thoughts are correct.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:48.920
Keita may be perverted, nonsensical, and hard to understand,

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.690
but he's very interesting.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.900
But I can't believe the "Reluctant Nadeshiko"

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.700
formed a contract with Keita's cousin.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:02.200
Yes, I was fortunate.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.940
I was able to make a pledge to a very wonderful person.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.540
He's no normal man?

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.550
That's right.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:15.820
That's why ten Inukami including me have come to him.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.650
Ten of that, huh?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:22.860
But surely it's pretty troublesome to have 10 women.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.300
Thanks for waiting.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.300
You look great after a bath.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.470
Keita, keep your distance!

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.940
Hey, wait for me.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.010
Keita, come on.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.280
Well then, surveillance team, report.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:53.290
Nadeshiko seems pretty interested in Keita Kawahira.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.790
Yeah, she seems very happy.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:58.630
- What's going on?
- Unbelievable.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:02.330
Nadeshiko really is weird to like a guy like him.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.500
Totally. Weird.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:08.700
If she keeps staying at
Keita Kawahira's place,

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.310
then our plan will succeed.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:13.680
But someone's in the way.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.080
Yoko.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:23.450
Yoko is trying hard so no more
Inukami attach to Keita.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:28.760
At this rate, Nadeshiko will return in a week as planned.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.230
Well then, what should we do?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.730
Then we should just eliminate Yoko!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.730
Huh? What's wrong?

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.840
Yeah, Tomohane is right.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.510
Yoko is indeed a tough opponent.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:47.840
Our past selves would've lost against her.

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:51.350
But now we can use Purgatory.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:55.620
One on one may be impossible, but the nine of us will win.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:04.060
I understand.
We shall eliminate Yoko.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:14.040
"Inukami!"

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.570
"I'm fighting Sendan and the others."

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.540
"No need to tell Keita. From Yoko."

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.250
Oh no, Yoko!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.250
Master Keita!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:28.380
What's up?

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:33.820
Basically, you want
Nadeshiko to stay at Keita's?

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:37.090
Yes. And you're obstructing that.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.500
What's so funny?

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:46.100
I mean, you're all supposed to vanquish evil,

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.570
but you try to kick out Nadeshiko.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:50.770
It's so funny.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.380
I don't mind fighting at all.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.150
Nadeshiko is the only scary one.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:02.580
There could be nine or 100 half-baked Inukami like you.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:03.890
No problem.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:08.760
And yet you've formed a contract with trash like Keita.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:14.730
That's right. Your master is a pervert and the worst human.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.870
You're more half-baked than us.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.740
That trash isn't worth getting mad for.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:26.070
He thinks an Inukami's sacred duty is just a part-time job.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:28.910
He's truly a worthless person.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:31.750
You guys too, huh?

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.050
Let me tell you.

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.690
I never back down once I take on a fight.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.390
If you keep insulting Keita,

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.690
I will bite all of you to death.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.500
Then, we have no other choice.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.700
Purification Flash.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.340
Manifestation x9. Crimson!

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:01.140
Like I said, because of me, Yoko is...

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:06.550
It's just Yoko fighting with your friends, right?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.720
I doubt that you're the cause.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.150
She likes to fight.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.990
Dragons have won 30 in a row.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:17.430
Umm, Master Keita?

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.490
- What?
- You're not helping her?

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:21.000
- Who?
- Yoko!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.460
Why?

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.200
Isn't Yoko your precious Inukami?

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:32.810
Look, her letter said that it isn't necessary to tell me, right?

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:34.280
Not, "Please come."

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:36.280
That's right, but so what?

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:39.210
Then isn't it fine if I don't go?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.250
I have misjudged you.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.920
Hey, listen. She's...

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.300
Dragons have won 30 in a row.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.100
Cease fire.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:04.740
Is she dead?

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.040
No way.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.280
Evil Fire!

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:28.330
Purification Barrier Type 2.
Purple Pillar.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:31.770
Oh? Not bad.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.470
But...

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:36.870
Uh, me?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.110
Yup. One confirmed death.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.880
Cute panties.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.450
Tomohane!

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.860
Evil Fire.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.660
Evil Blaze!

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.870
Yoko.

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:16.480
Everyone, aim for the kill!

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:31.760
Oh my.

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:35.730
It seems you've been protected by this Kaoru guy.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:39.970
You're spoiled, so you don't know who's stronger.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.500
You don't know who you shouldn't fight.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.870
Even though you're wild animals.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:49.510
I'm glad Keita isn't here.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.180
Yoko, please wait for me.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.850
Are you going to observe too?

00:15:58.320 --> 00:15:59.590
Master Hake?

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:01.590
It's going to be over soon.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:02.890
Look.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.260
Yoko.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.100
Master Hake, please stop them!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.870
Don't worry about Yoko.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:16.870
This match is completely in her favor.

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.950
Evil Fire.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:30.920
Sendan's group can use significant power when ten of them fight.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:34.960
But Yoko does not need other Inukami.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:38.190
She alone holds great power.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.200
That is Yoko.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:58.210
Everyone.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.080
Yoko.

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.620
Oh, you still want to go at it?

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.860
I won't forgive you.

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.290
Sendan, please don't move.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:14.200
Nadeshiko. She had the nerve to go easy on us...

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:19.170
When we tried to really kill her.
I won't forgive that!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:22.300
I didn't go easy that much.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.010
It was pretty close.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.710
Shut up!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.710
Sendan.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.380
You want to die that badly?

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:33.520
Then how about actually dying?

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:43.960
Yoko, the fight should be over.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:48.060
If you'll still fight, then I,
Nadeshiko, will fight!

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:51.000
Nadeshiko, you...

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:59.070
Oh, how scary.
I know which one of us is stronger.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:00.840
I'm a wild animal.

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:02.640
Got that, stupid mutts?

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:07.350
I'm afraid of an angry Nadeshiko, so I won't kill you.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:12.850
Nadeshiko can do what you all together cannot do.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.390
Remember that.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:21.660
Hake, I'm afraid of Nadeshiko, so I'm going to run away.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:27.500
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:35.980
Hake. Yoko.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:37.680
Could it be...

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:45.150
Please, don't force yourself.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:06.640
Yoko, I made you play the villain this time.

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:10.910
Not really.
I just did it for my own sake.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:12.250
And besides...

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:13.480
Besides?

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:18.150
The old me would've easily killed them.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.460
But I thought, "What would Keita do?"

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:24.160
That stayed in my head as I fought.

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:27.700
Then, they looked really stupid.

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.500
I see.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:34.900
By the way, was it you that plotted all this?

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:40.010
I mean, bringing
Nadeshiko to my place,

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.010
and making me learn from her.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:46.310
Teaching the misunderstanding
Sendan group how to fight.

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:50.450
And then having them make up with Nadeshiko.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:54.190
Of course not.
I cannot foresee things like that.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.830
But of course,
I did wish that would happen.

00:19:58.490 --> 00:19:59.790
I see.

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.300
