Dragons have won 30 in a row.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.920
Well you're looking stylish.

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:30.930
Listen, Keita.
I got into a fight today.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:35.300
Oh? I didn't know that.
So, did you win?

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.370
Yup, I won.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:40.500
Well... That's good.

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.310
You're going to play dumb again?

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:52.350
I only did as you said.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:55.420
Just how far did you predict that?

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:00.390
Nadeshiko, the tea's ready.

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:01.520
Okay.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:04.190
Hurry up, everybody's waiting!

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.590
Yes, thank you, Tomohane.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:14.700
After what happened, I'm being treated very nicely by everyone.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.040
Yes, I'm very happy.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:22.780
Yes. I, Nadeshiko, will be by your side for eternity.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.780
Master Kaoru.

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:47.800
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.610
<i>Every girl is busy.</i>

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:58.810
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.020
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.650
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:07.290
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.590
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:13.700
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.640
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:24.110
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:35.680
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Let's fight</i>

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.790
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

